cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "inlaops: MLOps and tidymodels Bridge for inlabru Models"
abstract: >-
  Provides vetiver and tidymodels integration for Bayesian spatial and
  latent Gaussian models fit with inlabru. Includes a vetiver bridge
  (versioning, REST API serving, Docker packaging) for bru objects, broom
  tidiers, a parsnip model constructor scoped to fixed-effects models, and
  proper scoring rule helpers via inlabru::generate().
